{"id":"e987275dbc75bae6","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-formula.md","title":"Definition — 内建多类一阶公式语法","display":"Definition — 内建多类一阶公式语法","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-formula","aliases":["14-df-formula"],"display":"Definition — 内建多类一阶公式语法","depends_on":["[[14-df-many-sorted-signatures-and-terms]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-formula"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — 内建多类一阶公式语法"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0d0e27d414f41634\" href=\"?note=0d0e27d414f41634\" title=\"14-df-many-sorted-signatures-and-terms\">14-df-many-sorted-signatures-and-terms</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0d0e27d414f41634\" href=\"?note=0d0e27d414f41634\" title=\"14-df-many-sorted-signatures-and-terms\">14-df-many-sorted-signatures-and-terms</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IsSignature}(S)\">\\(\\operatorname{IsSignature}(S)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Var}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{Var}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Term}_{S,s}\">\\(\\operatorname{Term}_{S,s}\\)</span> 及项构造子采用该条定义。下列构造子以不同自然数标签编码；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,\\psi\">\\(\\varphi,\\psi\\)</span> 为公式输入，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t,u,t_i\">\\(t,u,t_i\\)</span> 为项输入，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 为变量输入。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t=u,r(\\vec t),\\top,\\bot,\\wedge,\\vee,\\to,\\forall,\\exists\">\\(t=u,r(\\vec t),\\top,\\bot,\\wedge,\\vee,\\to,\\forall,\\exists\\)</span> 分别是下式构造子的排版记号，量词变量的类由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{sort}(x)\">\\(\\operatorname{sort}(x)\\)</span> 唯一确定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{top}:=(2,\\varnothing),\\quad\\mathsf{bot}:=(3,\\varnothing),\\quad\\mathsf{eq}(t,u):=(4,t,u),\\quad\\mathsf{rel}(r,t_1,\\ldots,t_k):=(5,r,(t_1,\\ldots,t_k)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{top}:=(2,\\varnothing),\\quad\\mathsf{bot}:=(3,\\varnothing),\\quad\\mathsf{eq}(t,u):=(4,t,u),\\quad\\mathsf{rel}(r,t_1,\\ldots,t_k):=(5,r,(t_1,\\ldots,t_k)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{and}(\\varphi,\\psi):=(6,\\varphi,\\psi),\\quad\\mathsf{or}(\\varphi,\\psi):=(7,\\varphi,\\psi),\\quad\\mathsf{imp}(\\varphi,\\psi):=(8,\\varphi,\\psi),\\quad\\mathsf{all}(x,\\varphi):=(9,x,\\varphi),\\quad\\mathsf{ex}(x,\\varphi):=(10,x,\\varphi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{and}(\\varphi,\\psi):=(6,\\varphi,\\psi),\\quad\\mathsf{or}(\\varphi,\\psi):=(7,\\varphi,\\psi),\\quad\\mathsf{imp}(\\varphi,\\psi):=(8,\\varphi,\\psi),\\quad\\mathsf{all}(x,\\varphi):=(9,x,\\varphi),\\quad\\mathsf{ex}(x,\\varphi):=(10,x,\\varphi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A_S:=\\{\\mathsf{top},\\mathsf{bot}\\}\\cup\\{\\mathsf{eq}(t,u)\\mid\\exists s\\in S_0\\ (t,u\\in\\operatorname{Term}_{S,s})\\}\\cup\\{\\mathsf{rel}(r,t_1,\\ldots,t_k)\\mid r\\in R,\\ k\\in\\mathbb N,\\ \\operatorname{ar}(r)=(s_1,\\ldots,s_k),\\ \\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\\ t_i\\in\\operatorname{Term}_{S,s_i}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A_S:=\\{\\mathsf{top},\\mathsf{bot}\\}\\cup\\{\\mathsf{eq}(t,u)\\mid\\exists s\\in S_0\\ (t,u\\in\\operatorname{Term}_{S,s})\\}\\cup\\{\\mathsf{rel}(r,t_1,\\ldots,t_k)\\mid r\\in R,\\ k\\in\\mathbb N,\\ \\operatorname{ar}(r)=(s_1,\\ldots,s_k),\\ \\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\\ t_i\\in\\operatorname{Term}_{S,s_i}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"F_S^0:=A_S,\\quad F_S^{n+1}:=F_S^n\\cup\\{\\mathsf{and}(\\varphi,\\psi),\\mathsf{or}(\\varphi,\\psi),\\mathsf{imp}(\\varphi,\\psi)\\mid\\varphi,\\psi\\in F_S^n\\}\\cup\\{\\mathsf{all}(x,\\varphi),\\mathsf{ex}(x,\\varphi)\\mid x\\in\\operatorname{Var}_S,\\ \\varphi\\in F_S^n\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[F_S^0:=A_S,\\quad F_S^{n+1}:=F_S^n\\cup\\{\\mathsf{and}(\\varphi,\\psi),\\mathsf{or}(\\varphi,\\psi),\\mathsf{imp}(\\varphi,\\psi)\\mid\\varphi,\\psi\\in F_S^n\\}\\cup\\{\\mathsf{all}(x,\\varphi),\\mathsf{ex}(x,\\varphi)\\mid x\\in\\operatorname{Var}_S,\\ \\varphi\\in F_S^n\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Form}(S):=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}F_S^n,\\qquad \\neg\\varphi:=\\mathsf{imp}(\\varphi,\\mathsf{bot}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Form}(S):=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}F_S^n,\\qquad \\neg\\varphi:=\\mathsf{imp}(\\varphi,\\mathsf{bot}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：原书 X.1 的一阶语言。这里不再把 57 号书的公式系统作为默认上游；有限解析树递归内建于本书。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-many-sorted-signatures-and-terms","status":"resolved","id":"0d0e27d414f41634","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-many-sorted-signatures-and-terms]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-many-sorted-signatures-and-terms","status":"resolved","id":"0d0e27d414f41634","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S$ 满足 [[14-df-many-sorted-signatures-and-terms]] 的 $\\operatorname{IsSignature}(S)$；$\\operatorname{Var}_S$、$\\operatorname{Term}_{S,s}$ 及项构造子采用该条定义。下列构造子以不同自然数标签编码；$\\varphi,\\psi$ 为公式输入，$t,u,t_i$ 为项输入，$x$ 为变量输入。$t=u,r(\\vec t),\\top,\\bot,\\wedge,\\vee,\\to,\\forall,\\exists$ 分别是下式构造子的排版记号，量词变量的类由 $\\operatorname{sort}(x)$ 唯一确定。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{IsSignature}(S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Var}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Term}_{S,s}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi,\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"t,u,t_i","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"t=u,r(\\vec t),\\top,\\bot,\\wedge,\\vee,\\to,\\forall,\\exists","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{sort}(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{top}:=(2,\\varnothing),\\quad\\mathsf{bot}:=(3,\\varnothing),\\quad\\mathsf{eq}(t,u):=(4,t,u),\\quad\\mathsf{rel}(r,t_1,\\ldots,t_k):=(5,r,(t_1,\\ldots,t_k)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{and}(\\varphi,\\psi):=(6,\\varphi,\\psi),\\quad\\mathsf{or}(\\varphi,\\psi):=(7,\\varphi,\\psi),\\quad\\mathsf{imp}(\\varphi,\\psi):=(8,\\varphi,\\psi),\\quad\\mathsf{all}(x,\\varphi):=(9,x,\\varphi),\\quad\\mathsf{ex}(x,\\varphi):=(10,x,\\varphi).","display":true},{"tex":"A_S:=\\{\\mathsf{top},\\mathsf{bot}\\}\\cup\\{\\mathsf{eq}(t,u)\\mid\\exists s\\in S_0\\ (t,u\\in\\operatorname{Term}_{S,s})\\}\\cup\\{\\mathsf{rel}(r,t_1,\\ldots,t_k)\\mid r\\in R,\\ k\\in\\mathbb N,\\ \\operatorname{ar}(r)=(s_1,\\ldots,s_k),\\ \\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\\ t_i\\in\\operatorname{Term}_{S,s_i}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"F_S^0:=A_S,\\quad F_S^{n+1}:=F_S^n\\cup\\{\\mathsf{and}(\\varphi,\\psi),\\mathsf{or}(\\varphi,\\psi),\\mathsf{imp}(\\varphi,\\psi)\\mid\\varphi,\\psi\\in F_S^n\\}\\cup\\{\\mathsf{all}(x,\\varphi),\\mathsf{ex}(x,\\varphi)\\mid x\\in\\operatorname{Var}_S,\\ \\varphi\\in F_S^n\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Form}(S):=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}F_S^n,\\qquad \\neg\\varphi:=\\mathsf{imp}(\\varphi,\\mathsf{bot}).","display":true}],"bytes":2025,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-218","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-formula|Definition — 内建多类一阶公式语法]]"},{"id":"99e83f097dc38c76","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S$ 与原子公式集 $A_S$ 见 [[14-df-many-sorted-signatures-and-terms]]、[[14-df-formula]]。"},{"id":"c22badb838a7fca1","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Struct}_{\\mathcal E}(M,S)$、递归上下文积和项解释见 [[14-df-many-sorted-topos-structures]]；$M_{()}=1$，$M_{(\\vec x,z:s)}=M_{\\vec x}\\times M_s$。公式见 [[14-df-formula]]；子对象运算与量词见 [[14-df-subobject-quantifiers]]。"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-188","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-formula]]"},{"id":"478e22ff3fd55015","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S$ 为 [[14-df-many-sorted-signatures-and-terms]] 的签名；项、上下文与公式采用 [[14-df-many-sorted-signatures-and-terms]]、[[14-df-formula]] 的有限树编码。$u$ 遍历项和公式，$\\varphi,\\psi,\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Form}(S)$；$x,y,z\\in\\operatorname{Var}_S$，单替换中的 $t\\in\\operatorname{Term}_{S,\\operatorname{sort}(x)}$。$\\mathsf b\\in\\{\\mathsf{and},\\mathsf{or},\\mathsf{imp}\\}$，$Q\\in\\{\\mathsf{all},\\mathsf{ex}\\}$。$\\operatorname{FV}$ 在项上的定义见 [[14-df-many-sorted-signatures-and-terms]]。"},{"id":"7780fb047a21abcf","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"$S_Q$、$H$、$M_Q$ 是 Assertion 明确构造的两类签名、载体族及结构。下式的类、关系及变量编号 $0,1,2,3$ 是有限 von Neumann 序数，与范畴对象的标签无关。类标签 $0,1$ 分别解释为 $Q,P_Q$，关系标签 $2,3$ 分别解释为严格序及隶属关系；没有函数符号。变量编码、公式构造子、递归积 $\\Pi_H$ 和其投影采用 [[14-df-many-sorted-signatures-and-terms]]、[[14-df-many-sorted-topos-structures]]。$L,U\\in\\operatorname{Var}_1$ 和 $q,r,w\\in\\operatorname{Var}_0$ 是下式指定的互异变量；对任意 $v,v'\\in\\operatorname{Var}_0$、$V\\in\\operatorname{Var}_1$，排版 $v<v'$ 缩写 $\\mathsf{rel}(2,v,v')$，$v\\in V$ 缩写 $\\mathsf{rel}(3,V,v)$。$\\forall v:Q$、$\\exists v:Q$ 分别是 $\\mathsf{all}(v,-)$、$\\mathsf{ex}(v,-)$ 的公式量词缩写，其余逻辑符号采用 [[14-df-formula]] 的构造子缩写。"},{"id":"a437620e31ab5c03","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$P\\in\\mathcal U$ 为命题字母集。$\\mathsf{bot},\\mathsf{and},\\mathsf{or},\\mathsf{imp}$ 使用 [[14-df-formula]] 中彼此不同的有限元组构造子；命题原子 $\\mathsf{atm}(p)$ 另用标签 $11$。本条的公式均属于下式定义的 $\\mathrm{PFml}(P)$；$\\bot,a\\wedge b,a\\vee b,a\\to b$ 是这些构造子的排版记号。$\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{PFml}(P)$，$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{PFml}(P)$，$a,b,c$ 遍历该公式集合。$\\top_{\\mathrm{IPC}}$ 是本条的命题真式缩写。"},{"id":"40de54bc10b61c40","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S$ 是 [[14-df-many-sorted-signatures-and-terms]] 的签名，$M\\in\\operatorname{StructData}_{\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}}(S)$；有限元数积 $\\Pi_{M_0}$ 与结构分量见 [[14-df-many-sorted-topos-structures]]，公式、自由变量见 [[14-df-formula]]、[[14-df-free-variables-and-capture-free-substitution]]。各类载体 $M_s$ 允许为空。"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-219","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-formula|Definition — 内建多类一阶公式语法]]"}],"outgoing":["0d0e27d414f41634"]}